From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NebulaAGI <gyccc@gitcode.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] optimlib fallback: provide Simplex/Subplex for L_SUBPLEX placer (Nelder-Mead)

Upstream optimlib backend only ships particleswarm.hpp (G_PARTICLESWARM)
but the placer uses TOptimizer<L_SUBPLEX>. When LIBNEST2D_OPTIMIZER=optimlib
the build fails with DummyOptimizer static_assert. Provide lightweight
Simplex/Subplex optimizers that satisfy the Optimizer CRTP interface.
Previous stub just evaluated initial point, breaking minimizeCircle which
needs true optimization (test boundingCircle expects center 0,0 but stub
returned 5,0). Implement bounded Nelder-Mead (2D simplex) with clamping
to bounds and respecting StopCriteria (max_iterations, ftol). Also fix
particleswarm seed that incorrectly required nlopt::srand and add missing
includes. Include the fallback header from libnest2d.hpp when optimlib is
selected.

